  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f822a561fb1825bc",
      "translationZh": "我们发布了三个适用于 Apple Silicon 的 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next REAP 构建版本。与其称其中某个为“最佳”，不如根据各产物的确切配置和已公布的 oMLX 运行结果，给出选择它们的决策边界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e6c62275ea94b11",
      "translationZh": "这三个版本均为 qwen4_exp 的衍生版本，具有 48 个 Transformer 层、top-10 路由、保留的含 512 个专家的原生 MTP 预测器，以及配置为 262k 的上下文。仓库名称保留 BF16 以标识发布版本，但经检查，这些配置对应的是混合精度包，而非统一采用 BF16 的检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3b3de4519c06350",
      "translationZh": "构建版本 HumanEval LiveCodeBench PP tok/s TG tok/s 峰值内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a824735464faad7d",
      "translationZh": "97/100 非思考模式；96/100 思考模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c291aaccb4310bf1",
      "translationZh": "61/100 非思考模式；62/100 思考模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdd14fbdbdf052fb",
      "translationZh": "91/100 非思考模式；95/100 思考模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f40ebb6d6d300aa5",
      "translationZh": "55/100 非思考模式；56/100 思考模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cab1accb032ee56",
      "translationZh": "硬件：M4 Max，40 核 GPU，128 GB 统一内存。PP = 提示词处理；TG = 文本生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c284927a181da0",
      "translationZh": "JUNDOT OQ4E 社区背景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1681dbcc2e90e6f",
      "translationZh": "Jundot oQ4e MTP 包是一个有用的社区基线，采用 512 个专家和 4 位量化。它用于提供背景，而不是用于比较胜负排名：专家数量、量化方式、运行时、批大小以及部分主机细节都有所不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "061adc6b21556e89",
      "translationZh": "共享的 LiveCodeBench 背景 硬件 包 批次 样本 得分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bb54018205f88f4",
      "translationZh": "Mensa REAP-384 oQ5e，思考模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8998171323345fc",
      "translationZh": "Jundot oQ4e MTP，思考模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e65deb28ba5d206",
      "translationZh": "这些使用相同的基准测试系列、样本量和主机类别，但仍不是受控的直接对比。尤其不要将此表解读为普遍适用的分数差异或胜者声明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69a65badf2b7520c",
      "translationZh": "已发布的 4k 吞吐量背景 芯片 / RAM 包 PP tok/s TG tok/s 峰值内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a6b4479eeb25102",
      "translationZh": "这些吞吐量行是部署快照，而不是速度排名。Jundot 的记录使用了更新的 M5 Max，以及一个不同的、采用 512 个专家和 4 位量化的包。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de20d7618d158f00",
      "translationZh": "你应该使用哪一个？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c87535e79ab9844",
      "translationZh": "如果你的优先考虑是…… 选择 理由",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c533967fadc7a491",
      "translationZh": "这组中实测编程表现最强",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "122e5be7dc393e5a",
      "translationZh": "这里已公布的 HumanEval 和 LiveCodeBench 成绩最高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e58b31039ec2f188",
      "translationZh": "内存占用更低、生成速度更快的 384 专家版本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0baf87b49244fb8b",
      "translationZh": "与 384 oQ5e 快照相比，峰值内存占用少了 11.3 GB，生成速度高了 5.4 TG tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfd0b8b9e6e45c13",
      "translationZh": "其公布的占用空间比 384 oQ5e 少 26.8 GB，比 384 oQ4e 少 15.5 GB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bbd92818a11dabf",
      "translationZh": "288 oQ4e 保留了相同的 48 层/MTP 结构，同时将目标专家库缩减至 288。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ef5553f5b584d71",
      "translationZh": "这些准确率数据基于包含 100 道题的分层抽样样本。吞吐量取决于具体的工作负载、主机和配置。HumanEval 和 LiveCodeBench 的结果分别呈现；不应将两者视为一个综合分数，也不应将其中任何一项视为对通用排行榜排名的宣称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d09dc62cdea8e1d",
      "translationZh": "模型卡包含原始 oMLX 记录、运行时设置、上下文长度、批大小、KV 策略和 MTP 状态。欢迎就其他可复现的评测套件提供反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8c9b26c5843e154",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/MensaProdigy 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
